Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Fourth Episode\NThe Assassins\NThe Stormy Coffin Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before today's episode, let's recap what happened up to last week.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.54,0:02:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the King went missing,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prince Sapphire was set to succeed him and take the throne.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tricked by the evil Duralumin and Nylon,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Queen accidentally let slip that Sapphire was actually a girl,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}resulting in them both being trapped in the terrifying Coffin Tower.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With Sapphire out of the way, Duralumin began{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}abusing his power, making the people suffer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Upon learning this, Sapphire{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}escaped through a secret passage shown by the mice, masked her face,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and became the mysterious Ribbon Knight to defeat Duralumin's henchmen...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and rescue the suffering people.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, Duralumin refuses to back down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Suspecting that Ribbon Knight might actually be Sapphire,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he sends invincible assassins to Coffin Tower.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, Sapphire and the Queen's lives are in grave danger!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And on that note, please sit back and enjoy today's episode.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bash you, you damn mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Little mice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What interesting little mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassins... They must be after our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for warning us, little mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting. Mother, assassins are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They've definitely come to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drive those assassins away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gama,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,lead the way. Where are the Prince and Queen's quarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure they're both inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they're locked in tight, they don't do much unless they're working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.59,0:05:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting a woman and a kid feels a bit underwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blast a hole in the door with this, then you fire a rocket right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The other three of you finish 'em off if they come at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this overkill?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.47,0:06:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you get in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight can enter from anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who lays a finger on the Queen and Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,will have to answer to the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that, you goons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare lay a finger on the Queen or Princess Sapphire ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... that kid, that figure... I've seen them somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire? It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They look so much alike... But no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be... but they look so alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, I've got to make sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gama! You startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of scary guys came and tried to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But then someone called the Ribbon Knight saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Gama, who is this Ribbon Knight anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I wrong? Still, they look so much alike...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin must have sent those assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him get away with this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach him a real lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have business with Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Most terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Most terrible news, absolutely terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight is trying to storm the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive him back and kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him leave alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm returning the assassins you sent to the Coffin Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How does your idiot henchman taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's another!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon appears wherever you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll fight you to the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these days, I'll definitely kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Barkeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the booze coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But you aren't going to pay me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Lord Duralumin's royal guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring us booze, or we'll feed your kid to your own dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry up and bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You soldiers of Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight is going to knock you senseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Get 'em, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ribbon Knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth did those men do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're being sent to the quarry just for singing the Ribbon Knight's song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight song?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the rage right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon, ribbon, Ribbon Knight is the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:13:00.44,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k53}Rib{\k53}bon {\k35}no {\k37}ki{\k37}shi {\k74}wa {\k46}cham{\k20}pi{\k75}on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:13:00.44,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight is the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:06.16,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k53}Rib{\k53}bon {\k35}no {\k37}ki{\k37}shi {\k74}wa {\k46}cham{\k20}pi{\k75}on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:06.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight is the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Ribbon Knight help the prisoners escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so elusive—no telling when or where he'll show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight is the champion. Isn't he splendid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan is guaranteed to catch the Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hit with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So we capture a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...and he's bound to come to the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we set our trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll fall for it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:47.26,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k53}Rib{\k53}bon {\k35}no {\k37}ki{\k37}shi {\k74}wa {\k46}cham{\k20}pi{\k75}on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:47.26,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight is the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:53.56,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k25}Du{\k22}ron,{\k14} {\k37}kin{\k38}gan, {\k32}Rai{\k45}ron, {\k40}san{\k45}san, {\k60}jan{\k162}po!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:53.56,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Duron, nearsighted, Rairon, sparkling, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:55.94,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k25}Jan{\k35}po{\k16}ro{\k79}rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:55.94,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Jump and bounce!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:14:01.26,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k53}Rib{\k53}bon {\k35}no {\k37}ki{\k37}shi {\k74}wa {\k46}cham{\k20}pi{\k75}on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:14:01.26,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight is the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:03.99,Karaoke - 24 stormy coffin tower 3 - Ribbon Knight is the Champion,,0,0,0,,{\k25}Du{\k22}ron,{\k14} {\k37}kin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:03.99,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Duron, near...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go. It's delicious juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, he's going straight to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry, and the Ribbon Knight will come to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he comes, he's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When he enters the plaza, rain cannons, rockets,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and arrows on him and finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasn't he shown up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Ribbon Knight chicken out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he too scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cry, the Ribbon Knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He came from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's burning! Water, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming at us like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, hurry home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get caught this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the Ribbon Knight's hideout!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know where the Ribbon Knight is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn't the time for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what a lovely young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking for Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely lady, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to tell Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just {\i1}so{\i0} dying to meet Lord Bushy-Eyebrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that guy, why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I still think Lord Bushy-Eyebrows is way dreamier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to escort you to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:17:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, wait here, young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin will be arriving shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll wait right here like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a polite young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, stay like that for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know where the Ribbon Knight is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to meet the Ribbon Knight because he's so dashing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you where the Ribbon Knight is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up and answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight is right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone capture the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised the Ribbon Knight would show up at the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I am, just as promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the crown back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You brainless, bumbling idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, bringing the Ribbon Knight right to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so mad I could burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:19:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really late today...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Sapphire to fetch water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.99,0:20:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens if she escapes the Coffin Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen gets tied up right along with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sapphire is fetching water right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.09,0:20:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go check!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's not there, the Queen gets this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, we're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.28,Karaoke - 23 the ribbon knight appears 2,,0,0,0,,{\k34}La {\k23}la {\k75}la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:20.42,Karaoke - 23 the ribbon knight appears 2,,0,0,0,,{\k33}La {\k24}la, {\k17}la{\k13}n {\k13}la {\k16}la{\k9}n {\k13}la {\k12}la{\k13}n {\k20}la{\k30}n {\k26}la{\k16}n {\k53}la{\k38}n{\k51}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:25.09,Karaoke - 23 the ribbon knight appears 2,,0,0,0,,{\k17}{\k35}So{\k27}no{\k50}u{\k52}chi{\k36} {\k39}ha{\k25}re{\k46}ma {\k62}ga...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:25.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,One of these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, Gama, You forgot to lock the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so I snuck out to play with the mice in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still started fetching water right on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You acted on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, something isn't right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm being duped...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Her wit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.41,0:22:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Her look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.06,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Her voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just one girl! She should be easy to crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She drove off the assassin and didn't fall for the trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No... wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of hearing about your "great ideas"!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the absolute best idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it's storming outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let this chance slip by...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.57,0:22:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to be patient than send a whole crowd of assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have it done quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonight's storm is perfect!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.38,0:23:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kill Sapphire and the Queen tonight!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have sent the reward with the messenger, Lord Nylon!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.01,0:23:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill both of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really feel like killing a girl, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:23:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... nowhere... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.59,0:24:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were looking for an escape hole, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, if you want out so bad, I'll let you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you won't leave alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:37.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.32,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.32,0:24:45.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.09,0:24:48.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.09,0:24:48.25,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
